    Bug 2047489 - Try to fix intermittent comm/mail/base/test/browser/getMessages/browser_getMessages_oAuth2.js | testBadRefreshToken - Uncaught exception in test - waiting for new imap messages to be received. r=vineet

    Increase timeout for obtaining messages from 5s to 20s.

    The race condition is: handleOAuthDialog resolves when the OAuth window closes, but the async token exchange fetch + modifyLoginAsync + IMAP auth and message sync can exceed 5 seconds on CI.

    Add MockAlertsService.reset() to make sure we don't come across some stale alert from previous runs.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D306697

